# Modern multi-select on the space-race replay (chapter 26, srtm), played with --modern. The player
# starts with many ships; shoplifter-1 (modern-orders) has only one that takes orders.
# Tick 600: a small drag box selects the orderable ship inside it (Cruiser #4).
600 ldrag 300 150 350 195
606 log-selection
# Shift (action 11, the target modifier) held: a second drag box adds the ships inside it (Heavy
# Cruiser #10 and Gunship #8) to the selection.
612 keydown 11
615 ldrag 375 195 470 260
624 keyup 11
627 log-selection
# A right-click on empty space: a group move, spread on a small grid around the point.
660 rclick 200 420
663 log-selection
# Zoom to show all (action 26), then a right-click where a Gaitori cruiser (initial 23) is drawn:
# a group attack.
900 key 26
960 rclick-initial 23
963 log-selection
# Control groups. Ctrl (raw key 224; in the replay tool's Classic bindings also the Order key,
# which in the Modern mode waits for release and is cancelled by the number) + 1 (action 34)
# saves the three selected ships as group 1; no order is given.
1000 keyevent-down 224
1003 key 34
1012 keyevent-up 224
# Select something else (Carrier #5), then 1 recalls the group, and a right-click moves it.
1020 select-initial 5
1023 log-selection
1030 key 34
1033 log-selection
1060 rclick 200 420
1063 log-selection
# Carrier #5 again, then Shift (action 11) + 1 adds the group to it: four ships.
1100 select-initial 5
1110 keydown 11
1113 key 34
1122 keyup 11
1125 log-selection
